Vendored third-party libraries
==============================

These libraries are bundled so that the corresponding AbiWord plugins
build without requiring users to install external dependencies.
Each is compiled as a libtool convenience library (noinst, PIC) and
linked statically into the plugin .so that needs it.

  librevenge-0.0.6   document-format support library (LGPL-2.1+/MPL-2.0)
                     used by libwpd, libwpg, libwps
  libwpd-0.10.3      WordPerfect document import (LGPL-2.1+/MPL-2.0)
                     used by the wordperfect plugin
  libwps-0.4.11      MS Works document import (LGPL-2.1+/MPL-2.0)
                     used by the wordperfect plugin (HAVE_LIBWPS)
  libwpg-0.3.4       WordPerfect Graphics import (LGPL-2.1+/MPL-2.0)
                     used by the wpg plugin

Only the library source subsets are vendored (inc/ + src/lib/ plus
licenses); upstream tools, fuzzers, tests and build scripts are not
included. The convenience-lib Makefile.am in this directory replaces
the upstream build systems.

link-grammar is vendored separately with its own autotools build
(see configure.ac AC_CONFIG_SUBDIRS) because it installs dictionary
data at runtime.

To update a vendored library: drop in the new upstream tree, keep the
same directory layout (inc/, src/lib/), and refresh the _SOURCES list
in Makefile.am.
